1800 DATA ""
1810 DATA ""
1820 DATA "             -  SO  I  BIT  HIM  -"
1830 DATA ""
1840 DATA ""
1850 DATA "(BUT JUST A NIBBLE)"
1860 DATA ""
1870 DATA ""
1880 DATA "OHNOIDONTBELIEVEITYPEDTHAT"
1890 DATA "A FUNNY THING HAPPENED TO ME ON THE WAY TO THE COMPUTER ROOM"
1900 DATA ""
1910 DATA "A PANHANDLER CAME UP TO ME AND SAID,""COULD YOU SPARE ME"
1920 DATA "$25,000 FOR A CUP OF COFFEE ?"
1930 DATA ""
1940 DATA """WHY SO MUCH"", I ASKED IN AMAZEMENT"
1950 DATA ""
1960 DATA """THINGS HAVE BECOME SO AUTOMATED"", HE REPLIED,""THAT THE ONLY WAY"
1970 DATA "I CAN ORDER IT IS WITH A COMPUTER"""
1980 DATA "IS THAT SUPPOSED TO BE FUNNY?"
1990 DATA "WHY DID MARQUIS DE SADE WANT TO RUN BASIC ON HIS WORD PROCESSOR ??"
2000 DATA ""
2010 DATA ""
2020 DATA "SO HE COULD HAVE WPS AND CHAINS ..."
2030 DATA ""
2040 DATA ""
2050 DATA ""
2060 DATA ""
2070 DATA ""
2080 DATA "WATCH IT !"
2190 DATA "WHY DID THE POPE HAVE A PDP-8 INSTALLED ??"
2200 DATA ""
2210 DATA ""
2220 DATA "SO HIS PROGRAMMERS COULD WRITE HOLY MACROS ..."
2230 DATA ""
2240 DATA ""
2250 DATA ""
2260 DATA ""
2270 DATA ""
